WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:05.300
The IT program is an engineering degree in information technology,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.180
where students can learn many things about technology.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.400
It's a well-rounded program. Companies today in the IT field

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.340
need well-rounded professionals who know a little of everything

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.340
so they can meet the needs of end users.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.940
The pandemic helped a great deal: many people

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.480
who perhaps didn't want to adapt, or resisted, did it anyway,

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.120
and we saw that many of the tasks we used to do on site

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:32.200
could be carried out virtually, and successfully.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.860
We invite the whole province, the whole country,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.660
to enroll in the Information Technology program,

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.940
in engineering, in information technology.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.840
Here at the Morona Santiago campus, come and also get to know

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.380
the city of Macas, a lovely, quiet city

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.220
to live in, to study in and to learn new skills.
